      <t indent="0" pn="section-6-9">IANA has created an IANA-managed registry titled &quot;IGP MSD-Types&quot;
under the &quot;Interior Gateway Protocol (IGP) Parameters&quot; registry to
identify MSD-Types as proposed in Sections <xref target="section-2" format="counter" sectionFormat="of" derivedContent="2"/> and <xref target="section-3" format="counter" sectionFormat="of" derivedContent="3"/>.  The registration
procedure is &quot;Expert Review&quot; as defined in <xref target="RFC8126" format="default" sectionFormat="of" derivedContent="RFC8126"/>.  Types are an
